340	+The map is generated: `sketch.ts` draws its north-west quarter in ASCII (`.` sea, `#` land, `%` shoal, `D` dock) and mirrors it into the other three, with the islands, spawn slots and hub. Shoal walls on the midlines open only near the hub, so ships sailing between islands meet there; reefs keep every stretch of open water within sight of an obstacle. The row three tiles south of the hub stays clear for 20 tiles either side of it, for the tests. To change the map, edit the sketch and run, from the repository root:
341	+
